        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2122] If DC was selected as the energy transfer mode, the first PowerScheduleEntry in the ScheduleExchangeRes is set to 0W and GoToPause is set to TRUE, the EVCC shall skip DC_CableCheck and DC_PreCharge and directly send a PowerDeliveryReq with ChargeProgress set to Pause.",
            "block_bbox": [
